{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19590","headline":"游栖霞寺 · 张汇","name":"游栖霞寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"跻险入幽林，翠微含竹殿。\n泉声无休歇，山色时隐见。\n潮来杂风雨，梅落成霜霰。\n一从方外游，顿觉尘心变。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张汇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}